00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:21,320
给 宝贝 整盘给我们吧
Here you go darling, give us the whole lot.

165
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:25,120
我的天啊
Oh, my God!

166
00:08:25,180 --> 00:08:27,420
美国运通黑卡
A black American Express card?

167
00:08:27,620 --> 00:08:30,640
我手里多久没有握着黑的了啊
I haven't held a black one in my hands in years.

168
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:37,640
我还以为你从没手握过"黑"[阳具]的人呢
I would've guessed you hadn't held a black one ever.

169
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:41,980
抱歉 今晚刚开张 只收现金
Sorry, it's our first night. Cash only.

170
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:46,180
他感觉都嗑傻了啊
Oh, wow. He is really out of it.

171
00:08:46,180 --> 00:08:48,400
-他嗑[上]啥了 -等会就是上我啦
- What is he on? - Besides me later?

172
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:51,520
不知道 但好嫉妒啊
Do not know, but am jealous.

173
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,740
我现在真的超嫉妒他啊
And now I'm really jealous.

174
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,180
他没事[人很棒]的
I'm sure he'll be fine.

175
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,780
我觉得他不只是很棒啊
Oh, I'd say he's more than fine.

176
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:02,020
他必须是我下一个男朋友啊
I'd say he's my next boyfriend.

177
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:04,920
罗兰 兄弟 醒醒啊
Roland, mate, wake up.

178
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,440
他停止呼吸了
He's not breathing.

179
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,520
叫不醒他 快叫救护车
I can't wake him, call 911!

180
00:09:09,060 --> 00:09:09,640
叫救护车啊
Call 911!

181
00:09:10,500 --> 00:09:13,197
大家冷静一下好吗
Let's all just calm down.

182
00:09:13,197 --> 00:09:15,163
这种场面我见多了
I have seen this happen a lot.

183
00:09:15,420 --> 00:09:17,060
有年暑假我去打工
One summer I had a part-time job

184
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:18,420
去吸毒所当紧急救护员
as a lifeguard at a crack house.

185
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,320
他很快就会醒来了
He'll come to in a second.

186
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:21,900
他死了
He's dead.

187
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,700
预言错了
Called that wrong.

188
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:33,200
麦克斯 昨晚死在我们小店门口的人
Max, the guy who died in front of our shop last night

189
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,160
生前是摇滚明星呢
was a rock star.

190
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,880
他跟凯特·摩斯约会过呢
He used to date Kate Moss.

191
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:38,060
无意冒犯 但跟凯特·摩斯约会
No offense, but dating Kate Moss

192
00:09:38,060 --> 00:09:39,400
就像是英国法律一样
is like a law in England.

193
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:42,800
每个人满21岁的时候都得上她一次
Everyone has to do it when they turn 21.

194
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:47,500
他叫罗兰·格拉斯 有两张金唱片
His name was Roland Gass, and he has two gold records.

195
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:49,040
真不敢相信我没听说过他
I can't believe I've never heard of him.

196
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:49,957
我能信
I can.

197
00:09:49,957 --> 00:09:53,577
你没事听的音乐是迪士尼音乐剧
Your go-to jam is the soundtrack from Newsies.

198
00:09:54,780 --> 00:09:57,200
昨天还是摇滚明星 今天就挂了
Yesterday a rock star, and today he's gone.

199
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,120
世事难料啊
You never know.

200
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,080
所以我跟街角那家
That's why I ordered us breakfast

201
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,740
华丽早餐店订了早餐
from the fancy breakfast place on the corner.

202
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,980
你从荣誉学餐厅订了早餐啊
You ordered from Magna Cum Latte?

203
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:07,920
每天经过他的店 我都想着两件事
Every day when I pass by it, I think two things:

204
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,480
一 我好希望有把枪
one, I wish I had a gun.

205
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:14,240
二 有一天要跟它们订早餐 让它们送
And, two, someday I'm gonna order breakfast to be delivered

206
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,020
那个牛逼哄哄的牛角面包来
with one of their fancy-ass croissants.

207
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:18,200
谁知道我今晚会不会吸食海洛因过量
Who knows, tonight I could do too much heroin

208
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,720
然后莫名其妙死了
and die an unexpected death.

209
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:22,000
但好歹我也死於一件我妈爱做的事之下
But at least then I'd die doing something my mother loved.

210
00:10:23,420 --> 00:10:25,520
你说得对 麦克斯 人生只有一次
You're right, Max. You only live once.

211
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:25,940
"人一"啊
Yolo.

212
00:10:27,020 --> 00:10:29,520
你下次再说"人一"的时候 就是你的死期
And you only live till the next time you say "Yolo."

213
00:10:36,180 --> 00:10:38,120
惨了 更多坏消息
Oh, no. More bad news.

214
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:40,720
我设置的麦克斯自制小蛋糕店谷歌搜索提示
According to my google alert for Max's Homemade Cupcakes-

215
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,220
你还设置对我们小店的搜索提示啊
You have a google alert for our business?

216
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,900
我只对"奥普拉裸上身"有设提示
I only have a google alert for "Oprah goes topless."

217
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:47,500
我不是说这一定会发生啦
I'm not saying it's gonna happen,

218
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:48,720
但如果真发生了
but I'm saying, if it does,

219
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,040
我会是第一个知道的人
I'm gonna be the first one to know.

220
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:54,340
网上都在传罗兰·格拉斯死在我们店门口
Look, it's online that Roland Glass died in front of our shop.

221
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,360
现在我手机也死了[没电] 死亡在传染啊
And now my phone just died. It's an epidemic.

222
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,700
奥列格 你还拿着我们小店的箭头在干嘛啊
Oleg, what are you still doing with the arrow from our shop?

223
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:02,800
你不是说挂好了吗
I thought you said that was hung.

224
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:04,700
我是说我鸟大[挂好了]
No, I said I was hung.

225
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,720
而现在也没法去帮你挂了
And I can't put it up now

226
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,860
你们窗口外有太多人了
with that crowd of people in front of your window.

227
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,980
有人在我们窗口外吗
There are people in front of our window?

228
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,540
兄弟 这里就是罗兰死的地方吗
Dude, is this where my man Roland died?

229
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,800
对啊 就这儿
Yeah, right over there.

230
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,860
那我要把这个放这 小熊放旁边
Then I'm gonna put this here next to paddington bear.

231
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,300
我在他上次演唱会上接到的
I caught this at his last concert.

232
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,800
然后还被人打[接]到了
And I also caught this.

233
00:11:27,780 --> 00:11:30,800
兄弟 所以他就这么倒下了吗
So, like, what, dude? He just dropped to the ground?

234
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:33,880
他是先撞到这里 笑了 然后才倒下
Actually, he hit right here first, smiled, then fell.

235
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,360
他还笑啦 兄弟
He smiled? Dude.

236
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:39,460
麦克斯 能过来说两句吗
Max, can I see you over here?

237
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:41,580
我也感到很遗憾 但帽子很屌哦
Sorry for your loss. And dope hat.

238
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,620
谢谢 我在垃圾堆捡到的
Thanks. I found it in a dumpster.

239
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:46,120
麦克斯 你在干嘛
Max, what are you doing?

240
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:47,540
别告诉人家他有撞到柜台啊
Don't tell them he hit our counter.

241
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:49,900
我们得让蛋糕店跟这事情撇清关系
We need to distance ourselves from the entire event.

242
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:52,100
这对我们的新生意犹如灾难
This spells disaster for our new business.

243
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:55,200
兄弟 能来三打小蛋糕吗
Dude, can I get three dozen cupcakes?

244
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:56,720
也可能是成功
Or it spells success.

245
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:01,320
我有爆多朋友要来参加守夜活动
I have beaucoup friends coming here for the midnight vigil.

246
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:03,340
你的小蛋糕卖多少钱啊
How much are your cupcakes?

247
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,060
好贵啊
That's a lot.

248
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:09,420
兄弟 罗兰会希望是这个价的
Dude. Roland would've wanted it that way.

249
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:20,300
* 敲呀敲 敲开天堂之门 *
* Knock, knock, knocking on heaven's door *

250
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:25,240
摔倒之前 他的头撞到了这里
And he hit right here before he fell.

251
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:29,520
而摔倒时 他抬头看着我微笑
And as he fell, he looked up at me and smiled.

252
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:32,560
一脸满足和平静
Content. Peaceful.

253
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,120
多谢7块钱 只收现金
That'll be $7, cash only.

254
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,820
给你一张50的 能破开吗
Mira, can you break a 50?

255
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:39,100
麦克斯
Max!

256
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:41,460
什么事
Yeah, what do you need?

257
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:44,129
-一张50块 给人找钱 -好的
- Change for a 50. - Got it.

258
00:12:44,129 --> 00:12:47,183
我是说 "好"可惜呀
I mean, why, God, why?

259
00:12:48,305 --> 00:12:51,660
* 敲呀敲 敲开天堂之门 *
* Knock, knock, knocking on heaven's door *

260
00:12:51,660 --> 00:12:53,600
给你四张10块
Ten, ten, ten, ten.

261
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:55,100
* 敲开金钱之门 *
* Heaven's door *

262
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,740
麦克斯 这里的小蛋糕快卖完了
Max, we're almost sold out in here.

263
00:12:57,780 --> 00:12:59,700
-你去厨房多拿点过来 -好的
- I need more cupcakes from the kitchen. - Got it.

264
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:00,580
我马上回来
I'll come right in.

265
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,120
厄尔
Earl?

266
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:06,280
分成跟以前一样啊 我七你三
Same split as before. 30 cents on every dollar you sell.

267
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,300
真是白费劲
What a waste.

268
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:11,240
你知道如果我们卖大麻能挣多少钱吗
You know how much money we could make if we sold pot?

269
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:14,520
那个你也想加入呀 分成照旧哦
Oh, you want in on that too? Same split.

270
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:19,820
天啊 嬉皮士的广藿香味
Oh, man, that hippie patchouli smell

271
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:21,040
比这里本来的屎味还难闻
is worse than the poop was.

272
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:24,620
阿憨 小声点 人们在哀悼呢
Han, shh. These people are in mourning.

273
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:25,620
放尊重点
Show some respect.

274
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,740
我吗 居然让我放尊重点
Me? Me show some respect?

275
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,060
你们俩接下来要干嘛
What will you two do next,

276
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:32,020
在儿童医院的糖尿病科卖小蛋糕吗
sell cupcakes at the diabetes wing at the children's hospital?

277
00:13:32,860 --> 00:13:34,960
你胆敢质疑我的真心
How dare you doubt my sincerity?

278
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,780
我曾两次亲自赶走
I personally have shooed a homeless man

279
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:38,600
一个要在悼念圣坛上撒尿的流浪汉
away from peeing on that shrine twice.

280
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:41,160
我不管27号下午的4点15分
I don't care what I may or may not have said

281
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,040
有没有说过什么话
on the 27th at 4:15 P.M.

282
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:45,420
你们的生意现在这么红火 我要收租金
Your business is booming, and now I want rent.

283
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:48,560
没门 那家伙本可以死在任何一个地方
No way, Han. That man could've overdosed anywhere.

284
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:51,740
但上帝把他送到我们窗前死 这是神赐之礼
But God made him overdose in front of our window as a gift.

285
00:13:51,940 --> 00:13:55,400
没错 因为人生只有一次 所以我们接受这份礼物
And, yes, we are accepting that gift because you only live once.

286
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:55,940
人一
Yolo.

287
00:13:57,260 --> 00:13:59,320
才不是 应该是"死一"
This isn't "yolo", It's "hodo""

288
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:00,998
人只能死一次
He only died once.

289
00:14:00,998 --> 00:14:04,500
我真惊讶你们居然没把这句话印成T恤来卖
I'm surprised you aren't selling "hodo" T-shirts.

290
00:14:04,500 --> 00:14:05,960
你怎么能这样说呢
How dare you again?

291
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,260
我们只是给需要安慰的人
We are simply providing some comfort food

292
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:09,760
提供一些安慰食物
to people who need comfort.

293
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:12,980
而且我要说 我们心怀着最崇高的敬意
And, I might add, we are doing it with the utmost respect.

294
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:16,620
* 敲呀敲 敲开苹果专卖店的大门 *
* Knock, knock, knocking on the Apple store's door *

295
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:19,280
够了 你们现在生意好得不得了
That's it, your business is booming,

296
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:20,620
我要收租金 200块
I want rent. 200.

297
00:14:21,180 --> 00:14:21,960
一年吗
A year?

298
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:25,760
是一个月 对于这么漂亮的地方算是很低啦
A month, and it's a bargain for my beautiful space.

299
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:28,659
这地方漂亮是因为我们把它变漂亮的
This space is only beautiful because we made it beautiful.

300
00:14:28,659 --> 00:14:30,040
对啊 给他看你的咬痕
Yeah, show 'em your bite marks!

301
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:31,120
麦克斯 我不要
Max, I'd rather not.

302
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:33,240
你们一个月要交租金200块
You will pay me $200 a month,

303
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,260
我意已决 你们做什么都没有用
and there is nothing you can do to change my mind!

304
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,740
-给他看你的咬痕 -好吧
- Show him your bite marks! - Fine!

305
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:40,520
她的屁股被老鼠咬了
A rat bit her ass?

306
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,460
好吧 那就收你们195块
Okay, 195.

307
00:14:42,700 --> 00:14:45,340
不许收租 阿憨 当初我们可不是这么说的
No rent, Han. That wasn't the deal you made us.

308
00:14:45,340 --> 00:14:47,460
这无关私人情谊 这是公事公办
This is not personal, it's business.

309
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,300
人家也想分一杯羹嘛
I want a slice of grief pie!

310
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:51,360
给他看你前面的咬痕
Show him your front bites!

311
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,240
不要 这太私密了
No! That's too personal.

312
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,180
-抱歉你不得不这么做 -我也很后悔
- Sorry you had to do that. - So am I.

313
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:00,400
-伤口愈合得不错嘛 -别骗我了
- It's healing nicely. - Don't lie to me.

314
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:06,420
我觉得把我们的花跟其他人的放在一起很不错
I think it's nice of us to add our flowers to the others.

315
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:07,360
以示尊敬
Shows respect.

316
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:09,340
说得好像这花不是你偷来的一样
You're acting like you didn't steal them.

317
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:11,780
麦克斯 有这份心就行了嘛
Max, it's the thought that counts.

318
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:14,340
而且我觉得从别人花园摘更便宜啊
And I thought it'd be cheaper to pull them out of someone's garden.

319
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,600
等等 悼念圣坛去哪儿了
Wait, where's the shrine?

320
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:21,407
瞧 阿憨把它挪到餐厅门口了
Look, Han moved it over to the diner door.

321
00:15:21,407 --> 00:15:25,620
那个厚颜无耻的伪君子
That insolent charlatan!

322
00:15:25,620 --> 00:15:27,100
不懂 但我支持你
Whatever that means.

323
00:15:28,552 --> 00:15:34,720
* 敲呀敲 敲开天堂之门*
* Knock, knock, knocking on heaven's door *

324
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,040
姑娘们 你们能相信吗
Can you believe this, girls?

325
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:38,180
他居然赚死人的钱
He's cashing in on a man's death.

326
00:15:38,820 --> 00:15:39,880
不带上咱们
Without us.

327
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:43,160
为了纪念他 今晚本餐厅供应
And in his honor, tonight we are serving

328
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,340
罗兰风味鸡排
Chicken a la Roland!

329
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:46,900
特别给大家打一个哀悼折扣 只需8块9毛5哦
At a mourner's discount of just $8.95.

330
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,620
看起来纯真的小蟋蟀转投黑暗面了
Looks like Jiminy Cricket turned to the dark side.

331
00:15:51,700 --> 00:15:53,900
还有摇滚明星布丁哦
I also have rock star pudding.

332
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:59,680
这样不行 麦克斯 这是我们的悼念圣坛
Nope. No way, Max. This is our shrine.

333
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:01,260
把公仔熊拿过去
Grab a handful of bears.

334
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:04,340
我们要把死人的悼念圣坛挪回去吗
We're moving the dead guy shrine back?

335
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,680
等等 让我先为我的自尊烧根蜡烛
Wait, let me just light a candle for my dignity.

336
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:07,940
它在这里死掉了
It died here too.

337
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:11,680
麦克斯 你到底想不想成功
Max, do you want to be successful or not?

338
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:14,260
因为如果你想 把这些
Because if you do, grab one of these poems

339
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:16,320
一点也不遵守诗词格律的烂诗撕下来
that doesn't follow any of the rules of poetry,

340
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,920
粘回我们蛋糕店的窗口
and move it back to the cupcake window.

341
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:21,320
因为这笔死人财是属于我们的
Because this is our death.

342
00:16:22,500 --> 00:16:24,860
我觉得你可能有点过于严苛了
I think maybe you're being a little harsh.

343
00:16:25,400 --> 00:16:27,440
"在天堂摇滚 爱你的凯文"
"Rock out in heaven. Love, Kevin."

344
00:16:27,971 --> 00:16:30,038
金句呀
That's gold.

345
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:31,420
哎呀 把蜡烛弄倒了
Oops, knocked over a candle.

346
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:34,260
没事 小火小火
Ooh, small fire, small fire.

347
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:35,560
烧到我的鞋了
Fire on my shoe.

348
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:39,060
如果我不把火弄灭 这就成了我的追悼会了
If I don't get this out, it's gonna be my memorial service.

349
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:42,080
大家快看
Look, look.

350
00:16:42,300 --> 00:16:44,840
这两个女人在破坏逝者的悼念圣坛
Those girls are disrupting the shrine of a dead man!

351
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:47,440
大家快看 有蟑螂从餐厅里跑出来了
Look, look, a roach got out of the diner!

352
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,320
快踩死他
Quick, step on it!

353
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:51,740
嬉皮士们 快看 把大麻烟枪放下看一眼
Look, hippies, look! Put down those bongs and look.

354
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,600
她们为了自己的利益
They're moving the place where a man died

355
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:55,140
居然转移逝者死亡的地方
for their own financial gain!

356
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,860
这样做可不酷哦 伙计
Hey, that's so not cool, man.

357
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,740
-对啊 快回来 -呸呸呸
- Yeah, come on. - Yeah, boo!

358
00:16:59,740 --> 00:17:02,620
-他才是那个不酷的人 -对啊 看他
- He's the not cool one. - Yeah, look at him!

359
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:08,580
罗兰·格拉斯是在我们可爱的
Roland Glass died a horrible death

360
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:10,560
小蛋糕店窗前可怕地死去
in front of our adorable cupcake window.

361
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:11,960
听见没 "可怕地 可爱地"
See? "Horrible, adorable"?

362
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:13,540
我脑子随便一转 想出来的词多押韵啊
That rhyme just came right off the top of my head.

363
00:17:15,060 --> 00:17:16,700
你好你好
Hey! Hi. Hi.

364
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:17,840
他知道
He knows!

365
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:19,900
我曾告诉他不要在悼念圣坛上撒尿
I told him to stop peeing on the shrine

366
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:21,460
当时圣坛就是在这边
when it was still over there!

367
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:22,480
对不对
Isn't that right?

368
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:23,980
对 就是这个贱人
Yep. That's the bitch.

369
00:17:24,220 --> 00:17:25,880
没错 我就是那个贱人
Yes! Yes! I'm the bitch!

370
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:29,500
这样可不酷 兄弟 把他扔出去
So not cool, dude. Let's get him out of here.

371
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,440
不要啊 住手
No! Stop!

372
00:17:33,740 --> 00:17:34,600
那是我的钱包
That's my wallet!

373
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,320
住手 那不是我的钱包
Ooh, stop! That's not my wallet.

374
00:17:38,180 --> 00:17:38,860
住手
Stop!

375
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:40,297
住手
Stop!

376
00:17:40,297 --> 00:17:43,679
《摇滚年代》的演员们 住手
Cast of Rock of Ages, stop!

377
00:17:44,340 --> 00:17:46,140
把他放下来 他很酷[自己人]
Put him down. He's cool.

378
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:47,940
即使衣着老土样子老气
Even with those clothes and that head.

379
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,980
我问你一句
I mean, really.

380
00:17:51,340 --> 00:17:53,040
我们有这么渴望成功吗
Are we that desperate for success?

381
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,840
宁愿阿憨被人五马分尸也在所不惜
We'd let Han be torn apart?

382
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:57,620
我在想
I'm thinking.

383
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:02,340
-卡洛琳 -麦克斯 我说了我在想
- Caroline- - Max, I'm thinking.

384
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:08,940
现在没人来敲呀敲
Well, no one's knock, knock,

385
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:10,260
敲开我们的大门了
knocking on our door now.

386
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:12,080
现在外面安静得
It's more dead out there

387
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:13,740
比有人死在外面还要死寂一片
than when there was a dead guy out there.

388
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:16,860
我重新考量了我们今天的行为
I'm having second thoughts about how we behaved today.

389
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:18,840
我是说 我们怎么可以保住阿憨的小命呢
I mean, how could we have let Han live?

390
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,240
你们好呀
Hello.

391
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:26,040
为了表示感谢 我给你们带来了摇滚明星布丁
I brought you some rock star pudding to say thank you.

392
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:28,540
摇滚明星布丁 里面都有啥 药
Oh, rock star pudding. What's in it, pills?

393
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:31,440
破碎的梦想 还是带着泪痕的女生内裤
Broken dreams? Tear-stained panties?

394
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:33,900
卡洛琳
Caroline?

395
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:36,320
我可不像麦克斯那么好哄[上]
I'm not as easy as Max.

396
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:38,840
我七年级的时候 班里每个女孩都这么说
Said every girl in my seventh grade class.

397
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:41,320
我错了
Look, I was wrong.

398
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:43,400
不 阿憨 是我错了
No, Han, I was.

399
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:44,600
我们应该给你租金的
We should pay rent.

400
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:46,441
我不是在说租金
I wasn't talking about the rent.

401
00:18:46,441 --> 00:18:49,297
租金 谁刚说租金了
Rent? Who said anything about rent?

402
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,600
我错了是因为当我说
I was wrong when I said

403
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:53,380
这无关私人情谊 这是公事公办
it wasn't personal, it was business.

404
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:55,540
在麦克斯阻止那群臭哄哄的嬉皮士
After Max stopped me from being torn

405
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:57,220
把我碎尸万段后
limb from limb by the smelly hippies,

406
00:18:57,940 --> 00:19:01,580
我意识到 我们之间大部分是私人情谊
I realized, with us, it is mostly personal.

407
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:03,060
只有小部分要公事公办
And a little business.

408
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,400
小部分公事公办
A little business?

409
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:06,000
你的"事"能有多"大"啊
What other kind could you have?

410
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:08,900
麦克斯 不要嘲讽阿憨嘛
Max, let's not be hard on Han.

411
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,160
他不要我们的租金
He's giving us this space rent-free.

412
00:19:10,820 --> 00:19:11,640
谁说不要租金了
No one said "rent-free."

413
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:15,980
我想到了一个公平的数字
I came up with a number I think is fair.

414
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,880
-25万 -是呀 真公平
- $250,000. - Yeah, sounds fair.

415
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:22,580
我记得这是你们俩第一家蛋糕店的目标
I remembered that was your original cupcake shop goal.

416
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:26,160
所以等你们达成那个目标 我们再说租金的事
So when you hit that amount, we can talk rent.

417
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:29,340
小憨憨 你真是太好了
Han, that is so sweet.

418
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:31,620
我不会把刚才她说的那句"硬憨"
And I'm not gonna ruin it by bringing up the fact

419
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:33,200
说出来破坏气氛呢
that she just said "hard on Han."

420
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:37,100
真的 阿憨 你真是太好了
Really, Han, it's so, so generous.

421
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:39,140
但我不知道我们承不承担的起
But I don't know if we're comfortable with it.

422
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:41,420
要不我们分你点股份吧
What if we offered you a small piece of the business?

423
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:44,080
我还是等租金吧 你们两个才是好姐妹好搭档
I'll wait for the rent. You two are good friends.

424
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:50,480
终于有女人愿意让阿憨"分一杯羹"
A woman finally offers Han a piece,

425
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,600
他却拒绝了
and he turns it down.

426
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:56,600
麦克斯 谷歌快讯
Max. Google alert.

427
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:57,760
奥普拉裸上身吗
Oprah's topless?

428
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:01,140
麦克斯 别想了 那是不可能的
Max, let that go. That's never gonna happen.

429
00:20:01,620 --> 00:20:02,840
你这态度就肯定不可能了
Not with that attitude.

430
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:07,020
验尸报告表示 罗兰·格拉斯
No, the autopsy says Roland Glass

431
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:08,620
是被麦克斯自制小蛋糕噎死的
choked on a Max's Homemade Cupcake.

432
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:09,740
这下真的是灾难了
This is a disaster.

433
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:13,340
你的热情上哪去了 瑞秋·芮小姐
Hey, where's your enthusiasm now, Miss Rachael Ray?

434
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:15,560
这小店最牛逼了
This place is the balls!

435
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,860
要不了多久
And it's just a matter of time

436
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,640
那些心理变态的嬉皮士就会来
till those sicko hipsters are lining up

437
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,780
排队要买"噎死罗兰"的小蛋糕了
for "one of those cupcakes that killed that dude""

438
00:20:22,220 --> 00:20:24,060
打开窗户 我们继续营业
Open the window! We're back, baby!

439
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:28,760
但我们也不能指望每周都有人死啊
But we can't count on a guy dying every week.

440
00:20:28,780 --> 00:20:30,460
没错 我是有乐观积极的态度
I mean, I have a positive attitude,

441
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:31,480
但这也太过分乐观了吧
but that's too pollyanna.

442
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:33,240
不需要啊
We don't have to.

443
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:34,920
这才是这扇窗最棒的地方
That's what's so great about this window.

444
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:36,020
谁都不知道下一秒会发生什么事
Who knows what'll happen?

445
00:20:36,220 --> 00:20:38,500
也是 我们也不必努力找生意
Right, and we won't have to chase business down

446
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:40,140
因为我们就在这条街上
because we'll be right here on the street

447
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:41,960
守株待兔
waiting for it to come to us.

448
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:45,520
麦克斯 我对未来的各种可能感觉好极了
Max, I feel so good about the possibilities.

449
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:47,820
昨晚是一张美国运通黑卡
One night it could be a black American express card,

450
00:20:47,820 --> 00:20:49,673
而另一晚
And the--

451
00:20:53,540 --> 00:20:55,080
麦克斯 是不是那个
Max, is it...

452
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:01,360
另一晚 是流浪汉
Other nights, it's a friendly little visit

453
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:02,080
友好地来拜访我们
from our homeless guy.
